{"slug":"mysos","title":"MySOS","desc":"A robust compact monitored personal safety alarm with two-way audio and a long-lasting battery that protects lone and hybrid workers 24/7 at the touch of a button","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/MySOS-hero-1.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Personal Safety Alarm\",\"title\":\"MySOS\",\"intro\":\"Simple, robust and versatile so your people can easily call for help in an emergency.\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eBS 8484:2022 accredited for lone working\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e24/7 support with 3-second response time\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eSOS button with two-way communication\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/MySOS-hero-1.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Pinpoint location\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Pinpoint-location.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Faster emergency responses\",\"heading\":\"Pinpoint location\",\"content\":\"Get staff locations within 5m² in an emergency in remote and built up areas thanks to a combination of GPS and Wi-Fi tracking alongside integration with What3Words.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":0,\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Check-in \\u0026 out\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/check-in-check-out.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Consistent updates\",\"heading\":\"Check-in \\u0026 out\",\"content\":\"Staff can check in and out of their working day or specific activities providing updates on their wellbeing.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/MySOS-tab1-1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Fall detection\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/fall-detection.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Raise an alarm hands-free\",\"heading\":\"Fall detection\",\"content\":\"Automatic alarm is raised when a fall is detected. Staff can get help when they may be incapacitated and unable to press the SOS button.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/MySOS-tab1-1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Enhanced connectivity\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Sim.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Keep workers connected\",\"heading\":\"Enhanced connectivity\",\"content\":\"Automatically use the strongest network to receive the best possible connection with the built-in roaming sim.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/MySOS-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Clearer communication\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/audio.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Unmatched audio clarity\",\"heading\":\"Clearer communication\",\"content\":\"Front-facing speaker makes it easier for staff to hear the alarm controller when they speak through the device.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/MySOS-tab4.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Designed for you\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/986518830/f6859357d5\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>MySOS is not an off-the-shelf product. Unlike others on the market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s a specially developed <a href=\"/uk/lone-workers/\">lone worker support</a> device with a built in <a href=\"/uk/lone-workers/man-down-alarm/\">man down alarm</a> created by Peoplesafe using our market expertise and feedback from our users who benefit from:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>IP67-rated casing</strong> – reduce the need for replacements</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>4G enabled</strong> – alarm functions can be performed quicker</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Magnetic charger</strong> – removes the common cause of damaged units</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/1135376582/a4d0227782\",\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC). By activating the <a href=\"/uk/panic-alarms/\">panic alarm</a> they can be connected rapidly. We provide the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/side-tabs {\"title\":\"MySOS in action\",\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Engineer Attacked\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAn engineer was verbally and physically assaulted by a customer during a home visit. The engineer activated an SOS alarm, prompting immediate police dispatch. The alarm controller followed protocol, contacting the engineer’s manager while awaiting police arrival. Police arrived within five minutes and the situation was resolved without injury.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/mysos-in-action-2-1024x806.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Social Worker Abused\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA social worker faced verbal abuse from a neighbour during a home visit. Feeling unsafe, they discreetly activated an alarm. The alarm controller called the social worker, gathered details, and dispatched police with precise location and risk information. Police arrived within 10 minutes and resolved the situation.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/mysos-in-action-3-1024x806.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Stranded in Snow\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA utilities engineer was stranded in the snow with no mobile signal. Using a Peoplesafe device, they activated an SOS alarm and connected to the ARC. The controller used the engineer’s Nexus profile to locate family and provide their precise location via What3Words. The ARC remained on the line with the engineer until help arrived.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":0,\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/quote {\"quotes\":[{\"quote\":\"“Peoplesafe helps to protect our nurses, doctors, social workers, psychologists and support workers, some of which have had to activate their alarms in real life emergency situations when carrying out home visits. The MySOS device gives our staff discreet protection, it allows for our staff to be able to raise an alarm without being seen by patients”.\",\"attribution\":\"Catherine Kwamya\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Central-and-North-West-London-NHS-Foundation-Trust.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"quote\":\"“The brilliant thing about the MySOS device is that it can also be used for general monitoring if there is a situation that does not necessarily warrant a police response. An incident in the late hours saw one of the service users become verbally abusive and there was a risk he would become physically violent. The staff member activated his Peoplesafe unit and the police were on site within 5 minutes, which is very rare. They were able to take the service user away and the staff member resumed normal duties.”\",\"attribution\":\"Nichola Chalmers, Head of HR\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Ready-Homes.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"quote\":\"“It’s simple and easy to use, plus it gives staff the feeling of security. If a system is difficult then staff just won’t use it. Just by having it on their person makes them feel more confident.”\",\"attribution\":\"Karl Reid, Health, Safety and Security Manager\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Sutton-and-East-Surrey-Water-logo.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/caption-slider {\"title\":\"Industries using MySOS\",\"cards\":[{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/NHS.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"NHS\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/nhs/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Council.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Councils\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/councils/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Housing.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Housing\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/housing/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Utilities.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Utilities \\u0026 Telecoms\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/utilities-telecoms/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Retail.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Retail\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/retail/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Transport.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Transport\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/transport/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Charity.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Charity\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/charity/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Manufacturing.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Manufacturing\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/manufacturing/\",\"linkTarget\":false},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Estate-Agents.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Estate Agents\",\"link\":\"/uk/sectors/estate-agents/\",\"linkTarget\":false}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/4/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the MySOS device can enhance the safety and security of your lone workers?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how MySOS provides reliable protection and rapid response to ensure your employees are protected in any situation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/4/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Proactively manage people risk\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/nexus-hero-1.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Add people, allocate MySOS devices and monitor usage from our award-winning Nexus platform. Connect your staff, managers and our ARC in one place for simple people management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Managers have a comprehensive 360º view of an employee’s safety in one location, including contact details, medical information, voice notes and activity timers. You can also see device specific information such as battery life, last known position and serial number.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visually engaging reports provide actionable insights on user engagement with the service so you can make changes to improve personal security.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Our Accreditations</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/image-columns {\"style\":\"cards\",\"items\":[{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/8484.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eBS 8484:2022\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur service is fully accredited against the British Standard for the provision of lone worker devices and service.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/ISO-27001-1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eISO 27001: 2017\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe adhere to information security best practice and deliver the highest standard of data security to our clients.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/cyber-essentials.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eCyber Essentials Plus\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe have the highest certification after being independently assessed to ensure our systems and information are cybersafe.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/50518.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eBS EN 50518:2019\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC) is a category I which is designed, constructed and operated to a higher standard than a category II.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Accessories\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Accessories Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/accessories/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/mysos-docking-station-1.png@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>MySOS is versatile making it suitable for various work environments and risk profiles. We offer a range of accessories, including belt holsters, identity badge holders, fixed bases and Klick Fast options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/accessories/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Accessories Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a MySOS demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-07-16/2jj3gy\",\"height\":550} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Alternative solutions\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:lone-worker-app@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:mysos-id-badge-4g@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":1,"types":["safety-devices"]}